<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 89,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 89,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts Monday were 89,000 head, compared with the estimate of 90,000, USDA said. Opening trade not well established.  Early sales Barrows and Gilts were $0.50-$1.00 per cwt higher than midsession Monday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    58.00 -59.00	   59.00 -60.00</p>
<p>few			57.50  59.50	   58.50  60.50</p>
<p>Sows:  steady to 2.00 higher.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs   44.00 -45.50	   44.00 -46.50</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   44.00 -46.50	   44.00 -46.50</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    47.00 -48.00	   47.00 -49.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
